  "title": "Delhi AQI Deteriorates Amid Diwali and Rising Pollution",
  "summary": "Delhi's air quality deteriorated to the'very poor' category on Diwali eve, with AQI readings reaching 364. The city's AQI improved slightly from 382 on Friday to 369 on Saturday, but several monitoring stations still recorded severe pollution levels. The situation highlights ongoing challenges in air quality due to smog and vehicle emissions.",
